The ETT e-bike is an e-bike designed explicitly for food delivery riders. The model offers an e-bike as a service with a removable battery with a capacity of over 1000wh - much larger than most other electric bikes available. The renting company guarantees all the maintenance services such as bike battery swap and repairing. The B2B service is designed to respond to the clients' specific needs that need a functional bike to maximise deliveries and facilitate the ride.